#: RelationshipDNA/relationshipDNA.gpr.py:4
msgid ""
"Produces a relationship report for all Persons with cM overlap with the "
"active person. For each person who has a DNA overlap (as quantified in cM), "
"create cM association for the main person and specify the associated person. "
"Add a Note to the Association with the numeric value of the cM match between "
"the two people. Report will display the associated person Ancestry ID "
"attribute if present (person attribute of Ancestry ID)."
msgstr ""
